        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9010/305, Modern Rectangular 12 Inch Cabinet Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 12 Inch Rectangular Cabinet Pull is a great example of the modern design aesthetic. The rectangular shape paired with today's most popular finishes including satin brass, polished chrome, and oil-rubbed bronze make for a very contemporary kitchen cabinet door handle. The Modern Rectangular 12 Inch Cabinet Handle has a 14 inch overall length. It comes packaged with all the necessary installation hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis pull is available in <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=omn-9010\"><b>Other Sizes</b></a>:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/4-inch-rectangular-cabinet-pull-omnia-9010-102\"><b>4 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/6-inch-rectangular-cabinet-pull-omnia-9010-153\"><b>6 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/8-inch-rectangular-cabinet-pull-omnia-9010-203\"><b>8 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/10-inch-rectangular-cabinet-pull-omnia-9010-254\"><b>10 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, and \r\n<a href=\"/products/18-inch-rectangular-cabinet-pull-omnia-9010-457\"><b>18 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Omnia Ultima 9010 Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 14\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-C08PC3_size.gif?v=1704354638\" width=\"600\" height=\"144\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
